<section class="section" aria-labelledby="process-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="process-h">From business idea to professional brand</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><h3>Tell us about your business</h3><p>Complete a short branding questionnaire so we understand your business, audience and preferences.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Explore your concepts</h3><p>We develop initial logo and visual identity concepts based on your selected package.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Refine your brand</h3><p>Review the concepts and request changes within your package's included revision rounds.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Receive your brand assets</h3><p>Once approved, receive your final digital branding files and applicable brand guidelines.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--mist" aria-labelledby="branding-faq-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><h2 id="branding-faq-h">Branding questions</h2></div>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>What is included in a branding package?</summary><div><p>Each package includes a defined selection of logo designs, visual identity assets and digital business materials. Compare the packages above to find the option that fits your business.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Can you redesign my existing logo?</summary><div><p>Yes. We can use your existing logo as a starting point and develop an updated visual identity based on your preferences.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Do I receive the original logo files?</summary><div><p>Your package includes the applicable final digital logo files, including high-resolution and vector formats where specified.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>How many revisions are included?</summary><div><p>Each package includes a specified number of revision rounds. Additional revisions can be discussed separately.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Do you print business cards or wrap vehicles?</summary><div><p>Our branding packages include digital design files and visual concepts. Physical printing, installation, manufacturing and vehicle wrapping are not included.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Can I purchase branding without a website?</summary><div><p>Yes. Branding is available as a standalone service.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Can I combine branding with website development?</summary><div><p>Yes. Branding can be purchased alongside a Starter, Growth or Growth Partner website to create a consistent visual identity across your business.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>How long does branding take?</summary><div><p>Delivery timelines depend on your selected package, project requirements and feedback. We'll confirm the expected timeline before starting your project.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Who owns the final designs?</summary><div><p>Final design ownership and permitted usage are governed by the applicable branding service agreement. Third-party fonts, stock assets and licensed materials may have separate usage conditions.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Can I request a refund?</summary><div><p>Refund eligibility depends on the applicable service terms and the stage of your project. Review the branding service agreement before purchasing.</p></div></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

